  "bio": "Lucky Tattoo, hailing from Brunswick, Germany, is a mosaic of professionalism in the tattoo industry. Specializing in black & gray, realism, and trash polka, they ensure each piece is a testament to their dedication, offering a superbly clean and hygienic environment for clients. Their attention to detail and adherence to the highest standards make them a trusted name for anyone seeking intricate and stunning body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Brunswick, Lower-saxony, Germany"
